  "markdown": "##### [cppreference.com](https://en.cppreference.com/index.html)\n\n[Create account](https://en.cppreference.com/mwiki/index.php?title=Special:UserLogin&returnto=cpp%2Fmemory%2Fallocator&type=signup)\n\n- [Log in](https://en.cppreference.com/mwiki/index.php?title=Special:UserLogin&returnto=cpp%2Fmemory%2Fallocator \"You are encouraged to log in; however, it is not mandatory [o]\")\n\n##### Namespaces\n\n- [Page](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/memory/allocator.html \"View the content page [c]\")\n- [Discussion](https://en.cppreference.com/w/Talk%253Acpp/memory/allocator.html \"Discussion about the content page [t]\")\n\n##### Variants\n\n##### Views\n\n- [View](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/memory/allocator.html)\n- [Edit](https://en.cppreference.com/mwiki/index.php?title=cpp/memory/allocator&action=edit \"You can edit this page. Please use the preview button before saving [e]\")\n- [History](https://en.cppreference.com/mwiki/index.php?title=cpp/memory/allocator&action=history \"Past revisions of this page [h]\")\n\n##### Actions\n\n# std::allocator\n\nFrom cppreference.com\n\n< [cpp](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp.html \"cpp\") \u200e \\| [memory](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/memory.html \"cpp/memory\")\n\n[C++](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp.html \"cpp\")\n\n|     |\n| --- |\n| [Compiler support](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/compiler_support.html \"cpp/compiler support\") |\n| [Freestanding and hosted](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/freestanding.html \"cpp/freestanding\") |\n| [Language](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language.html \"cpp/language\") |\n| [Standard library](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/standard_library.html \"cpp/standard library\") |\n| [Standard library headers](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/headers.html \"cpp/header\") |\n| [Named requirements](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/iterator/concepts.html \"cpp/named req\") |\n| [Feature test macros](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/fe